Description: A tidy interface to the open data of the Observatory of
    Pernambuco, Brazil (<https://cf.pe.gov.br/observatorio>): municipal
    series on population, economy, public finance, labour, education,
    health, security, transport and environment, collected from official
    public sources (such as the Brazilian Institute of Geography and
    Statistics and the Ministry of Health, identified in every row) and
    organised by 'Condepe/Fidem', the State Agency for Planning and
    Research, every source in the same long format, returned as tibbles.
    Also provides the municipal boundaries and eleven official regional
    classifications of the municipalities, ready for maps, and citations
    that credit the original source. Files are read from the canonical
    endpoint with a 'Hugging Face' mirror as fallback, cached on disk per
    catalogue version and checked against their published 'SHA-256'.
    Network failures are handled gracefully.
